---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="How it works"
  description="How a visa appointment opening becomes one free Telegram message."
>
  <main class="section prose">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>How it works</h1>
      <p>
        The Chrome extension is the next piece we are building. This page is the
        product it will serve.
      </p>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>You install the extension and choose a post, a visa class, and OFC or consular.</li>
        <li>You connect Telegram. The bot can message that chat, and nothing else.</li>
        <li>
          Someone who is already on the official scheduling site sees a date. The
          extension reports that date. It does not click, type, or book.
        </li>
        <li>
          If several people see the same opening, it is still one alert. Everyone
          whose filters match receives that message once.
        </li>
        <li>You open the official site and book it yourself, if the date is still there.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>
        A slot can disappear before you arrive. The message means the date was seen,
        not that it is being held.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
